{"id":"sukunamahoraga","lines":[{"t":0.614,"end":7.736,"chars":[0],"who":"Megumi","text":"I imagine the head of the clan used this in much the same way back then.","de":"Ich stell mir vor, der Clan-Chef hat das damals genauso benutzt.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":7.736,"end":27.794,"chars":[0],"who":"Megumi","text":"Sacred treasure swing and ring, ring.","de":"Heiliger Schatz — schwingen und klingen, klingen.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":27.794,"end":30.186,"chars":[1],"who":"Haruta","text":"He tricked me!","de":"Der hat mich reingelegt!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":30.186,"end":31.923,"chars":[1],"who":"Haruta","text":"He's starting that ritual!","de":"Er startet das Ritual!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":31.923,"end":36.67,"chars":[1],"who":"Haruta","text":"and hes forcing me to participate in the damn thing with him!","de":"Und zwingt mich, bei dem verdammten Ding mitzumachen!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":36.67,"end":39.22,"chars":[0],"who":"Megumi","text":"Eight-Grip Sword...","de":"Achtgriff-Schwert…","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":39.22,"end":41.553,"chars":[0],"who":"Megumi","text":"Divergent Sila Divine General...","de":"Divergenter Sila — Göttlicher General…","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":41.553,"end":49.035,"chars":[0],"who":"Megumi","text":"Mahoraga.","de":"Mahoraga.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":49.035,"end":55.236,"chars":[1],"who":"Haruta","text":"Make Haruta say something?","de":"*Haruta schreit panisch*","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":55.236,"end":57.019,"chars":[0],"who":"Megumi","text":"See you later.","de":"Bis später.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":57.019,"end":58.453,"chars":[1],"who":"Haruta","text":"Yeah!","de":"Ja!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":58.453,"end":61.303,"chars":[0],"who":"Megumi","text":"Sorry, Itadori.","de":"Sorry, Itadori.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":61.303,"end":64.186,"chars":[0],"who":"Megumi","text":"Hey, you damn bastard.","de":"Hey, du verdammter Bastard.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":64.186,"end":65.903,"chars":[0],"who":"Megumi","text":"I'll be dying first.","de":"Ich sterb zuerst.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":65.903,"end":67.97,"chars":[0],"who":"Megumi","text":"Give it your best.","de":"Gib dein Bestes.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":67.97,"end":79.87,"chars":[2],"who":"Mahoraga","text":"Make Mahoraga say something?","de":"*Mahoraga brüllt*","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":79.87,"end":82.048,"chars":[1],"who":"Haruta","text":"Wait!","de":"Warte!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":82.048,"end":84.103,"chars":[1],"who":"Haruta","text":"wait, wait, wait, wait!","de":"Warte, warte, warte, warte!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":84.103,"end":86.942,"chars":[1],"who":"Haruta","text":"Oh, fuck you!","de":"Fick dich!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":86.942,"end":88.389,"chars":[1],"who":"Haruta","text":"Damn it!","de":"Verdammt!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":88.389,"end":91.553,"chars":[1],"who":"Haruta","text":"Wake up, you shitty sorcerer!","de":"Wach auf, du beschissener Zauberer!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":91.553,"end":99.32,"chars":[1],"who":"Haruta","text":"Huh?","de":"Hä?","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":99.32,"end":102.736,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Suspended animation, huh?","de":"Scheinbarer Tod, was?","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":102.736,"end":108.12,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"I see.","de":"Verstehe.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":108.12,"end":139.603,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Time for a tasting, then.","de":"Zeit für eine Kostprobe.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":139.603,"end":158.486,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Dissect.","de":"Zerteilen.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":158.486,"end":165.62,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"If i was a cursed spirit, that would have eliminated me on the first blow.","de":"Wär ich ein Fluchgeist, hätte mich der erste Schlag schon erledigt.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":165.62,"end":177.436,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Tastes awful. *pftt*","de":"Schmeckt scheußlich. *ptt*","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":177.436,"end":193.925,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"You wanna go?!","de":"Willst du Ärger?!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":193.925,"end":201.903,"chars":[2],"who":"Mahoraga","text":"Make Mahoraga say something?","de":"*Mahoraga brüllt*","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":201.903,"end":246.23,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Hm? hmph.","de":"*hmph*","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/31.mp3"},{"t":246.23,"end":251.286,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Heh.","de":"Heh.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/32.mp3"},{"t":251.286,"end":276.542,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"He!","de":"He!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/33.mp3"},{"t":276.542,"end":290.353,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"now that felt odd.","de":"Das hat sich gerade komisch angefühlt.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/34.mp3"},{"t":290.353,"end":298.703,"chars":[2],"who":"Mahoraga","text":"Mahoraga grumbles or something","de":"*Mahoraga knurrt*","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/35.mp3"},{"t":298.703,"end":343.053,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Again?!","de":"Schon wieder?!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/36.mp3"},{"t":343.053,"end":347.153,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Cursed energy?","de":"Fluchenergie?","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/37.mp3"},{"t":347.153,"end":376.717,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"You've done it now!","de":"Jetzt hast du’s geschafft!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/38.mp3"},{"t":376.717,"end":383.395,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Sukuna Manic laughing","de":"*manisches Lachen*","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/39.mp3"},{"t":383.395,"end":429.843,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"You can see it! You see my technique!","de":"Du siehst es! Du siehst meine Technik!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/40.mp3"},{"t":429.843,"end":483.403,"chars":[2],"who":"Mahoraga","text":"Mahoraga says something?","de":"*Mahoraga greift an*","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/41.mp3"},{"t":483.403,"end":488.303,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"I knew it. You're similar to Yamata no Orochi.","de":"Ich wusste es. Du bist ähnlich wie Yamata no Orochi.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/42.mp3"},{"t":488.303,"end":493.633,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"You follow my slices and attack with cursed energy...","de":"Du folgst meinen Schnitten und greifst mit Fluchenergie an…","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/43.mp3"},{"t":493.633,"end":497.336,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Both started happening after that great wheel revolved","de":"Beides fing an, nachdem sich dieses große Rad gedreht hat","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/44.mp3"},{"t":497.336,"end":499.776,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"The incantation of sacred treasures","de":"Der Zauberspruch der heiligen Schätze","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/45.mp3"},{"t":499.776,"end":503.32,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"and that great wheel both represent perfect cycles and harmony.","de":"und dieses große Rad stehen beide für perfekte Zyklen und Harmonie.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/46.mp3"},{"t":503.32,"end":509.906,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Which suggests that this shikigami's ability is to adapt to anything and everything,","de":"Was darauf hindeutet, dass die Fähigkeit dieses Shikigami ist, sich an alles anzupassen,","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/47.mp3"},{"t":509.906,"end":514.886,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"its the ultimate late-throw rock-paper-scissors!","de":"es ist das ultimative nachgeworfenes Schere-Stein-Papier!","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/48.mp3"},{"t":514.886,"end":523.12,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"You might have defeated me in the state i was in back then.","de":"In dem Zustand von damals hättest du mich vielleicht besiegt.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/49.mp3"},{"t":523.12,"end":526.399,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Domain Expansion:","de":"Bereichsausweitung:","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/50.mp3"},{"t":526.399,"end":540.07,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Malevolent Shrine.","de":"Unheilvoller Schrein.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/51.mp3"},{"t":540.07,"end":542.82,"chars":[3],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Open.","de":"Öffne.","orig":"scenes/sukunamahoraga/lines/52.mp3"}]}